 rust/helpers/helpers.c.orig | 104 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 rust/helpers/virtio.c       |  37 +++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 142 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 rust/helpers/helpers.c.orig
